@HostAddress = http://localhost:5000

### Health Check
GET {{HostAddress}}/health
Accept: application/json

### Basics - Set Cache
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/basics/my-key?ttlSeconds=120
Content-Type: application/json

"Hello L2Cache (Simple String)"

### Basics - Get Cache
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/basics/my-key
Accept: application/json

### Basics - Exists Cache
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/basics/my-key/exists
Accept: application/json

### Basics - Remove Cache
DELETE {{HostAddress}}/api/basics/my-key
Accept: application/json

### Product - Get (Loads from ProductLoader)
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/product/1001
Accept: application/json

### Product - Update (Write-Through)
PUT {{HostAddress}}/api/product/1001
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": 1001,
  "name": "Updated Product",
  "price": 199.99
}

### Product - Reload from Source
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/product/1001/reload
Accept: application/json

### Product - Batch Get
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/product/batch
Content-Type: application/json

[1001, 1002, 1003]

### User - Get (Loads from CustomUserLoader)
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/custom-inheritance/users/1
Accept: application/json

### Advanced - Cache Statistics
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/advanced/stats
Accept: application/json

### Telemetry - Health
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/telemetry/health
Accept: application/json

### Telemetry - Metrics
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/telemetry/metrics
Accept: application/json
